{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1000_p", "source_sha256": "414954765470ddb0dec6517ccbfa3aed39754f6c704a86321e005fdaaaefc9eb", "ja": "（クリスマスライブが終わり、打ち上げということで、\nまつりとアクアリウム展へ行ってきた）", "zh": "（圣诞演唱会结束后，为了庆祝演出顺利结束，和まつり一起去了水族馆展览）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "8729192aaa499f161e0f328b509ca306bc7c74ab023942556096b5b721ad7dab", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　姫のお願いを\n聞いてくれて、ありがとうなのです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生！　谢谢你\n答应公主的请求哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "aa8bf88d2bafb29b7bf1a5b579f48f54fed21b79a14021093adc757b75a54327", "ja": "優雅に泳ぐウミウシたち……とってもびゅーりほー！\nな空間で、思わずうっとりしちゃったのです♪", "zh": "优雅游动的海蛞蝓们……真是太美丽了！\n在这样的空间里，不知不觉就看得入迷了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0a6e1c619ef9407bbbdc807dd974f63040ff0e1f36e5f20405aebcb5f84bcb00", "ja": "楽しんでもらえたならよかったよ。\n俺にとっても、いい息抜きになったし。", "zh": "你能玩得开心就好。\n对我来说，这也是个不错的放松机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "78020ed236a0fa10385d99c705474a023dd31d6e80b9bd1e298962b14f226be6", "ja": "はいなのです！　それに、\nクリスマスライブも楽しかったのですよ。", "zh": "是的！而且，圣诞演唱会也玩得很开心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "f79a9dbce296ef8001a2f33f0db2dcab717386039cb8df4f9510d5a8c9d7e88a", "ja": "ファンのみんなに、ちゃんとプレゼントふぉーゆー！\nできたので、姫はとっても満足なのです。", "zh": "给粉丝们好好送上了礼物！  \n姬非常满足哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0ffe97c3c31587e01e5885390a726ff9914a47775bde4272771335d91eee24b7", "ja": "ああ。袖で見ていたけど、みんな嬉しそうだったな。\nまつりが、サンタさんみたいに見えたよ。", "zh": "啊。我在侧台看着，大家看起来都很开心。\n小祭看起来就像圣诞老人一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "882f8283439d3ec36c5f4563c3d4a6d9ed4254c12d6c655803f5f5e3950afcbe", "ja": "それはよかったのです！\nまつりサンタも、とびきり・はっぴー！なのです♪", "zh": "那真是太好了！茉莉圣诞老人也超级开心哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "fdbdc16d7c25c4766fd8b8713179e22199fc729fee3f89be9ecf2b7e6a2f6881", "ja": "プレゼントって、あげる側も、\nとっても幸せな気持ちになれるのですね。", "zh": "原来送出礼物的一方，也会感到非常幸福呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b6fc64dbd8322ef834114401eab7f6b300f911f45e8164b3dea63d903c2b37d4", "ja": "そうだな。プレゼントを渡した人が喜んでくれると、\n自分も幸せな気持ちになれるもんな。", "zh": "是啊。收到礼物的人开心的话，送礼物的人自己也会感到幸福嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "f9fb04446e38d50b207f3523f39061cd3d73bd77262649a39baaeed2cb543324", "ja": "ふふっ♪　それなら{$P$}さんも今、\n幸せなのですね？　姫に指輪をくれましたから。", "zh": "呵呵♪ 那么，{$P$}先生现在也感到幸福了吧？因为您送给公主戒指了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "0e0a0236312ee0f01442435bc90b7cff7cc6dbcbbca725ad0c8e167fef482c2f", "ja": "あの指輪には、不思議な魔法があるのです。\n身に着けると、幸せな気持ちになれるのですよ。", "zh": "那枚戒指有着不可思议的魔法哦。\n只要戴在身上，就能让人感到幸福呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8e9282fee798f0eedea1c1cb6a4e2427ed4f863ff748fd4b9045da2b1623a839", "ja": "そこまで言うと、ちょっと大げさじゃないか？\n高い指輪じゃないから、なんだか悪いけど。", "zh": "说得这么夸张，会不会有点过头了？又不是什么贵重的戒指，总觉得有点过意不去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "c324cd421ca4369e683fff1a061be8be08192be7455a693338ce6e07a70781a5", "ja": "ほ？　{$P$}さんが、姫のことを\n考えてプレゼントを選んでくれたおかげなのですよ？", "zh": "哦？还不是因为{$P$}先生想着姬，特意挑选了这份礼物吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "ae8580a6b8565a4c54a95a9ed0a1094ffb3e9b14616782d1cba810994cfa3aac", "ja": "ふとした時に、指輪を見るだけで、\n大切な思い出をすぐに思い出すことができるのです♪", "zh": "每当不经意间看到戒指，就能立刻想起珍贵的回忆哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d08df006fb8e156ea3f784af6c464147f795117a4c78f7b807960a1ab8f80baa", "ja": "なるほど、思い出が大切だってことか。\nそれならわかるよ。", "zh": "原来如此，也就是说回忆很重要啊。\n这样的话我就明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "df17523034714eca8f4e0985ca6630a0201c19a31309bfb305a1f166d4e06242", "ja": "はいなのです♪　指輪は姫の宝物として、\nこれからもずっと大切にするのですよ。", "zh": "没错♪ 戒指是本公主的宝物，所以今后也会一直珍惜它哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0243_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "c51b4b59ce55d9c7bae0acf12042f1a1a28c241087aaeade8e0dadb7e26345c0", "ja": "なので……{$P$}さんも。\n今日のこと、忘れないでくださいね……ね？", "zh": "所以……{$P$}先生也一样。今天的事，请不要忘记……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
